Z||000001||TRiAD||07-09-2001||11:15 PM||||TSW wheels are heavy, the offsets are never as listed, and the finish is literally soft, like the powdercoat (or paint, depending on color) was not done properly or didn't dry. <P>This info comes from years of being an aftermarket shop and experience with several (10+ before I quit carrying them) sets of TSW wheels. <P>Good luck finding another option. <P>FYI. <P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
