Z||000012||FieroPerformance||07-15-2001||01:09 AM||||First off. I bought TSW wheels and I am VERY happy with them. I got them on clearance for $75 each. They are 16" TSW blades. The customer service was OUTSTANDING. I have hit a 5" verticle curb going 40+ mph with only a slight bend to my rear wheel. (i didn't even notice until a month later)<P>-Charlie<BR>-----<BR>jackalrr@hotmail.com<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
